Section: None
Text: Thus, we use state-of-the-art NLI features to detect this unique pattern [8,23,14]; the feature set consists of bag of stopwords, Part- of-speech tags (POS), and syntactic dependency relations (DEPREL). We 9 Total pronouns, Anxiety, Cognitive processes, Insight, Causation, Discrepancy, Ten- tative, Certainty, Inhibition, and Inclusive respectively.

Rank: 10
Source: 1910.01340.pdf
Page: 4
Section: None
Text: With this set of features we aim to model the tweets of the accounts from several perspectives. 4.1 Thematic Information Previous works [26] have investigated IRA campaign eﬀorts on Facebook, and they found that IRA pages have posted more than ∼80K posts focused on di- vision issues in US. Later on, the work in [7] has analyzed Facebook advertised posts by IRA and they speciﬁed the main themes that these advertisements discussed.

